guide forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades
title Tirisfal Glades
faction Horde
race Undead
levels 1-13
zone Tirisfal Glades
next forever/horde/02-the-barrens

# Route: the simulator's consensus Undead route (data/sim/export/
# consensus-horde-undead, visit 1, levels 1-11.9). Checked against the
# 2026-10-14 export: same Tirisfal quests, same order apart from turn-ins
# and accepts swapped within a Brill visit.
#
# Flow: Deathknell -> the road east past Calvin Montague and Gordo -> Brill
# (bind) -> Doom Weed north of town -> west fields, Gordo, Calvin's duel ->
# hearth -> the north: Rot Hide graveyards, Maggot Eye, the Vile Fin coast ->
# Brill -> Deathguard Linnea's camp -> Brill -> west loop: Agamand Mills,
# Solliden, the pumpkin fields, the Crusader's Outpost, the Whispering Forest
# and Shadowvale -> hearth -> Brill -> the Scarlet camp south of town -> Brill
# -> east loop: Linnea's camp, the Balnir Farmstead cultists and graves,
# Captain Vachon, the Vicious Night Web Spiders -> Linnea's camp -> Brill ->
# Captain Melrache on the north-east coast -> Brill -> Leonid in the Whispering
# Forest -> hearth -> zeppelin to Durotar -> the Crossroads (flight path, bind).
#
# Optional: A Letter Undelivered (361). A Letter to Yvette drops from the
# Agamand Mills undead about one kill in 25-30, so its accept and turn-in never
# block. Rear Guard Patrol (99156, Forever): Riptear, a level 13 elite
# abomination, wanders the woods next to the Vicious Night Web Spiders of the
# east loop; the quest is taken and handed in at Linnea's camp, which the route
# visits before and after that loop.
#
# Deviations from the export (same quest set apart from "Left out"):
# - Patience (99141): the export accepts and turns it in on the spot; here the
#   three reports are asked for where you pass Dillinger, Gordo and Kristof.
# - Marla's Last Wish (6395, level 3) is taken after Night Web's Hollow and A
#   New Plague (367, level 6) on the second pass through Brill, where the
#   route is sure to meet their level requirements.
# - The Adventurer (96656) is taken from Executor Arren with Vital Intelligence
#   and handed to Eleanor Shackleton on the first walk out of Brill (export:
#   picked up at 9.9, turned in at 10.3).
# - A New Plague, A Putrid Task and Sticks and Bones are done in the fields
#   west of Brill on the way to Calvin's duel instead of after the hearth back.
# - Deaths in the Family (354) is taken with The Haunted Mills at 7 and done
#   at Agamand Mills during the west loop; the export takes it at 12 and walks
#   back to the mills for it (then hearths from there).
# - Rear Guard Patrol (356) and Hides for the Forsaken (97558) are taken at
#   Linnea's camp when Forsaken Duties is turned in at 9.3 (export: 11.9); the
#   murloc skins come from the west-loop shore, the wings and hides from the
#   bats and darkhounds you pass anyway. Tomb Weed (99142) is taken from
#   Holland at the 10.3 turn-in round (export: 12.0).
# - The export runs Brill -> spiders -> Brill -> Vachon -> Brill -> Melrache ->
#   Brill -> cultists -> Agamand Mills -> hearth. Here everything east of Brill
#   is one loop after the Scarlet camp, Melrache is one trip from Brill and the
#   third hearth comes after Leonid (export hearths at 6.4, 10.3 and 12.1).
# - The export's Crossroads flight path and bind at 12.9 close this guide:
#   zeppelin from the towers by the Ruins of Lordaeron, then the walk through
#   Durotar to the Crossroads, where the next guide starts.
#
# Class quests: Paladins take A Difficult Path (98601) from Sarvis,
# Rediscovering the Light (90902, Holy Light) and Coming to Terms (91208, the
# Frightened Paladin west of the church) from Aramis Hammerhand in
# Deathknell, then Continue Your Training (91209) to Shari Stilwell, their
# trainer in Brill; Warlocks do Piercing the Veil (1470, Summon Imp) with Venya
# Marthand on the Rattlecage Skeletons. At about 10 from Brill: Warriors kill
# Ulag the Cleaver north of town (1819, Defensive Stance); Warlocks take
# Creature of the Void (1473) from Carendin Halgar in the Undercity on the way
# to the Scarlet camp, where Egalin's Grimoire lies in Perrine's Chest, and
# bind the Voidwalker (1471) in the Undercity before the zeppelin; Priests
# learn Touch of Weakness (5658) from Aelthalyste on the same Undercity stop.
# In Favor of Darkness / Garments of Darkness (5651, 5650, Priest) reward a
# robe, not a spell: not taken.
# Mages: at 10 Cain Firesong in Brill sends them to Anastasia Hartwell in the
# Undercity (1881) on the way to the Scarlet camp, the Balnir Snapdragons
# (1882) are picked in the east loop, and the hand-in waits for the last
# Undercity stop.
# Class letters: Sarvis's level 1 letter for each class (Simple Scroll 3095
# Warrior, Encrypted Scroll 3096 Rogue, Hallowed Scroll 3097 Priest, Glyphic
# Scroll 3098 Mage, Tainted Scroll 3099 Warlock; Paladins: A Difficult Path
# 98601) is taken after The Mindless Ones and handed to the trainer at the
# church.
# Class training at Deathknell (2, 4) and in Brill (6, 8, 10, 12).
#
# Paladin only: As Above, So Below (99152, Hilda the Breaker) and The One
# That Got Away (99153, Ephram Barbaro) at Bandarion Keep. QuestieDB has no
# class gate on them, but a Scourge Mage (Mike_, 0.2.3) found neither in the
# givers' quest windows, and warcraft.wiki.gg calls Hilda a Forsaken paladin
# trainer: the keep is the Paladin hub. Other classes skip the keep; the
# Shadowvale elixir bottles (95314) stay for everyone.
#
# Left out for Paladins: the Bandarion Keep chain (91282-91317, 95803) and A
# Lesson in Divinity (94427-94441, Redemption) run from Bandarion Keep on the
# west coast to the Undercity and Deathguard Falgan at the far east end of the
# glades and back: three crossings of the zone for a resurrection spell solo
# leveling does not need. They are the Class guide
# forever/class/paladin/tyrs-watch.
#
# Left out: The Prodigal Lich (405, Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity): the
# export accepts it and never turns it in. With it go the Prodigal Lich chain
# and the Undercity flight path of the older Tirisfal guide. Leonid's Letter
# (98545, Glix Xizzix in the Undercity, 90 XP) is not on the new export's
# route at all.
# Left out: the export's Sepulcher stop at 11.9-12.2 (Delivery to Silverpine
# Forest 445, Supplying the Sepulcher 6321, Ride to the Undercity 6323,
# Michael Garrett 6322, Prove Your Worth 421, Arugal's Folly 422). The new
# export goes on into Silverpine from there, while this route goes to the
# Barrens first; tried as a detour from Brill to the Sepulcher and a bat to
# the Undercity before the zeppelin, it cost 0.03 h to level 20 under the
# simulator. Arugal's Folly (422) could not have been added anyway: nothing in
# the data places its Remedy of Arugal.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Deathknell

step Undertaker Mordo
  tip You rise in the crypt at the south end of Deathknell. Undertaker Mordo waits just outside.
  accept 363

step Shadow Priest Sarvis
  tip Follow the path north into Deathknell; Sarvis stands in front of the church.
  turnin 363
  accept 364

step Mindless Zombies
  tip The zombies shamble around the graveyard and the houses just east of the church.
  kill 1501 quest 364.1
  kill 1502 quest 364.2

step Shadow Priest Sarvis
  turnin 364
  accept 3901
  accept 376                          -- Novice Elreth, beside the church
  accept 98389                        -- Aramis Hammerhand
  accept 3095 only Warrior            -- Shadow Priest Sarvis: Simple Scroll
  accept 3096 only Rogue              -- Shadow Priest Sarvis: Encrypted Scroll
  accept 3097 only Priest             -- Shadow Priest Sarvis: Hallowed Scroll
  accept 3098 only Mage               -- Shadow Priest Sarvis: Glyphic Scroll
  accept 3099 only Warlock            -- Shadow Priest Sarvis: Tainted Scroll
  turnin 3095 only Warrior            -- Dannal Stern, the warrior trainer
  turnin 3096 only Rogue              -- David Trias, the rogue trainer
  turnin 3097 only Priest             -- Dark Cleric Duesten, the priest trainer in the church
