step Rattlecages, scavengers and duskbats
  tip Rattlecage Skeletons wander the ruined houses in the north half of Deathknell. Young Scavengers and Duskbats roam all around the village; the Ragged Scavengers and Mangy Duskbats are on its east side.
  kill 1890 quest 3901.1
  collect 3265 quest 376.1
  collect 3264 quest 376.2

step Rattlecage skulls
  only Warlock
  tip The Rattlecage Skeletons in the ruined houses drop the skulls.
  collect 6281 quest 1470.1

step Back to the church
