  only Paladin,Warlock
  tip Paladins: Rediscovering the Light is done once you have healed five Injured Deathguard around the church with Holy Light.
  turnin 90902 only Paladin           -- Aramis Hammerhand: Holy Light
  turnin 1470 only Warlock            -- Venya Marthand: Summon Imp

step Scavenging Deathknell
  tip The Equipment Boxes lie beside the ruined houses in the north of Deathknell.
  collect 11127 quest 3902.1

# Night Web's Hollow: "26,60 nightwebs and entrace to cave"
