# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West loop

step Agamand Mills
  tip Follow the road north-west to Agamand Mills. Devlin Agamand walks the graveyard south of the mills; Nissa, Gregor and Thurman Agamand haunt the mills themselves. Rattlecage and Cracked Skull Soldiers drop the ribs, Darkeye Bonecasters the skulls, and any of them may drop A Letter to Yvette. From here on, kill the Duskbats and Darkhounds you pass: Shelene wants their wings and hides.
  collect 2831 quest 362.1            -- Devlin Agamand
  collect 2828 quest 354.2            -- Nissa Agamand
  collect 2829 quest 354.1            -- Gregor Agamand
  collect 2830 quest 354.3            -- Thurman Agamand
  collect 3162 quest 426.1
  collect 3163 quest 426.2
  collect 2839 optional               -- A Letter to Yvette, a rare drop
  accept 361 optional                 -- Only if the letter dropped

step Deathguard Simmer
  tip Walk south-west to the Solliden Farmstead; Simmer stands at the farm.
  accept 365

step Tirisfal Pumpkins
  tip The pumpkins grow in the Scarlet-held fields north-west of Solliden.
  collect 2846 quest 365.1

step Crusader's Outpost
  tip Scarlet Warriors guard the outpost just west of the pumpkin fields. Bareth Dawnstone is held inside: talk to him and stay with him until he is out.
  kill 1535 quest 427.1
  accept 99144                        -- Bareth Dawnstone
  goto 32.0,46.3 "Crusader's Outpost" -- Escort Bareth out of the outpost
  complete 99144

step Vile Fin shore
  tip More Vile Fin murlocs walk the shore just north of the outpost.
  collect 278244 quest 97558.3

