# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Captain Melrache

step Captain Melrache
  tip Follow the road north-east from Brill past Brightwater Lake. Captain Melrache and his two Scarlet Bodyguards hold the Scarlet watchtower on the north-east coast, north of the Scarlet Watch Post: pull the bodyguards first.
  kill 1665 quest 372.1
  kill 1660 quest 372.2

step Executor Zygand
  tip Back to Brill.
  turnin 372

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Leonid, then on to the Barrens

step Leonid Barthalomew
  tip Follow the road west past Agamand Mills to the Whispering Forest. Leonid stands just north of Hilda's camp.
  turnin 96899
  accept 96896
  turnin 96896                        -- Listen to Leonid and Danitha Morr, then talk to him again

step Hearth to Brill
  hearth "Gallows' End Tavern"

step The Undercity
  only Warlock,Priest,Mage
  zone Undercity
  tip The Undercity is under the Ruins of Lordaeron, beside the zeppelin towers. Carendin Halgar is in the Magic Quarter: use the Runes of Summoning on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker. Aelthalyste is in the War Quarter. Anastasia Hartwell is in the Magic Quarter too.
  turnin 1473 only Warlock            -- Carendin Halgar
  accept 1471 only Warlock
  use 6284 @86.6,27.1 only Warlock    -- Runes of Summoning
  kill 5676 quest 1471.1 only Warlock
  turnin 1471 only Warlock            -- Carendin Halgar: Summon Voidwalker
  accept 5658 only Priest             -- Aelthalyste
  turnin 5658 only Priest             -- Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness
  turnin 1882 only Mage choose 9514 7507 -- Anastasia Hartwell: The Balnir Farmstead

step Zeppelin to Durotar
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Walk south-east from Brill to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron and board the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (the other one goes to Grom'gol).
  goto 60.7,58.9 "Zeppelin tower"

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip The zeppelin lands at the tower just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate. Follow the road south into Durotar, cross the Southfury River bridge below Far Watch Post and follow the road west to the Crossroads.
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak, the wind rider master
  sethome "The Crossroads" npc 3934   -- Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind
